            "description": "<html><body><div class=\"wsb_wrapper\"> <div class=\"wsb_main\"><span><p data-eci=\"true\"><strong>Listen on the go! A daily podcast of Wall Street Breakfast will be available by 8:00 a.m. on <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/author/wall-street-breakfast?utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_medium=toptext&amp;utm_campaign=wsbpodpromo\">Seeking Alpha</a>, <a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/wall-street-breakfast/id1358381502\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">iTunes</a>, <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/05uLjJxkVgQsRk8LWLCLpx\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Spotify</a>.</strong></p></span></div> <figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture><img alt=\"\" data-id=\"2242931384\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1024\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1023px) calc(100vw - 132px), (max-width: 1199px) calc(100vw - 666px), (max-width: 1307px) calc(100vw - 708px), 600px\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2242931384/image_2242931384.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" srcset=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2242931384/image_2242931384.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536 1536w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2242931384/image_2242931384.jpg?io=getty-c-w1280 1280w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2242931384/image_2242931384.jpg?io=getty-c-w1080 1080w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2242931384/image_2242931384.jpg?io=getty-c-w750 750w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2242931384/image_2242931384.jpg?io=getty-c-w640 640w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2242931384/image_2242931384.jpg?io=getty-c-w480 480w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2242931384/image_2242931384.jpg?io=getty-c-w320 320w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2242931384/image_2242931384.jpg?io=getty-c-w240 240w\" width=\"1536\"/><figcaption><p class=\"item-credits\">hapabapa/iStock via Getty Images</p></figcaption></picture></figure>\n<p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\"> </p> <p><span class=\"b italic\">Up for a challenge? Test your knowledge on the biggest events in the investing world over the past week. Take the latest <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/quiz/70-investment-news-quiz-friday-sep-25-2026-09-25\">Seeking Alpha News Quiz</a> and see how you stack up against the competition.</span></p> <h2> </h2> <p><br/>Wall Street's major market averages advanced on the week while Treasury yields surged, oil and gas markets continued to remain in focus, and President Xi Jinping and President Trump wrapped up their summit.<br/><br/>U.S. Treasury yields kept climbing this week as the benchmark U.S. 10-year Treasury yield (<a class=\"ticker-link\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/US10Y\">US10Y</a>) <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4646648-just-how-high-will-the-u-s-10-year-yield-rise-by-year-end\" target=\"_blank\">topped</a> 5.15%, marking its strongest reading since July 2007.<br/><br/>Oil and gas markets remained in focus as reports surfaced that Washington and Tehran are exploring a <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4646788-hormuz-reopening-talks-are-back-in-play-as-washington-and-tehran-discuss-a-phased-deal\" target=\"_blank\">phased</a> arrangement to restore commercial traffic through the Strait of Hormuz.<br/><br/>Chinese President Xi Jinping wrapped up his U.S. state visit with President Trump, but the trip produced little beyond a two-month extension of the countries’ <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4646978-trump-xi-summit-key-takeaways\" target=\"_blank\">trade truce</a>.<br/><br/>For the week, the blue-chip Dow (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/DJI\" title=\"Dow Jones Industrial Average Index\">DJI</a>) added <span class=\"green\">+0.28%</span>, the benchmark S&amp;P (<a class=\"ticker-link\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/SP500\">SP500</a>) gained <span class=\"green\">+1.21%</span>, and the tech-heavy Nasdaq Composite (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/COMP:IND\" title=\"NASDAQ Composite Index\">COMP:IND</a>) climbed up <span class=\"green\">+2.06%</span>. Read a preview of next week's major events in <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4647180-catalyst-watch-jobs-report-trump-ai-talks-and-ticking-fee-time-for-paramount\" target=\"_blank\">Seeking Alpha's Catalyst Watch.</a><br/> </p> <h2><a class=\"!no-underline !text-share-text\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4647137-fed-rate-hike-odds-fedwatch-vs-prediction-markets\">Playing the odds </a></h2> <p>Markets are pricing in another interest rate hike in the Fed's meeting next month as inflation remains stubbornly high. It's interesting that prediction markets like Kalshi (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/KALSHI\" title=\"Kalshi Inc\">KALSHI</a>) and Polymarket (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/POLYMARKET\" title=\"Polymarket Inc.\">POLYMARKET</a>) tend to line up with expectations derived from Fed Funds futures. Such platforms may even complement traditional forecasting tools over time. <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4647137-fed-rate-hike-odds-fedwatch-vs-prediction-markets\"><span class=\"b\">Read more.</span></a></p> <p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\">Seeking Alpha's Calls Of The Week</p> <p>NNN REIT (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/NNN\" title=\"NNN REIT, Inc.\">NNN</a>) Has Crashed, It's <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4948248-nnn-reit-just-crashed-i-am-buying-rating-upgrade\">A Strong Buy For Me</a>.<br/><br/>Bullish On <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/PDBA\" title=\"Invesco Agriculture Commodity Strategy No K-1 ETF\">PDBA</a> ETF And The Potential <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4949508-pdba-etf-and-potential-for-super-el-nino-rating-upgrade\">For A Super El Niño</a>.<br/><br/>Amazon (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/AMZN\" title=\"Amazon.com, Inc.\">AMZN</a>): Market Misunderstands <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4949411-amazon-market-is-misunderstanding-the-threat-from-meta-muse-rating-upgrade\">Meta Muse's Threat</a>.<br/><br/>Centrus Energy's (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/LEU\" title=\"Centrus Energy Corp.\">LEU</a>) Drop Made The <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4949606-centrus-energy-the-selloff-has-finally-made-the-risk-worth-taking-rating-upgrade\">Risk Worth Taking</a>.<br/><br/>Bank of America (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/BAC\" title=\"Bank of America Corporation\">BAC</a>): Decent Value Play <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4949357-bank-of-america-decent-value-play-amid-sharp-selloff-upgrade\">Amid Sharp Selloff</a>.<br/><br/>Rivian Automotive (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/RIVN\" title=\"Rivian Automotive, Inc.\">RIVN</a>) Could Nail R2 And <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4948632-rivian-could-nail-r2-and-still-go-nowhere-downgrade\">Still Go Nowhere</a>.<br/><br/>Trinity (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/TRIN\" title=\"Trinity Capital Inc.\">TRIN</a>): 30% Premium Earned By <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4948555-trinity-capital-30-percent-premium-earned-by-strong-fundamentals-rating-downgrade\">Strong Fundamentals</a>.<br/><br/>Frontline (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/FRO\" title=\"Frontline plc\">FRO</a>): Excessive Valuation At <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4949090-frontline-record-valuation-at-uncertain-times-sell-downgrade\">Uncertain Times, Sell</a>.<br/><br/>Walmart (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/WMT\" title=\"Walmart Inc.\">WMT</a>) Is Failing To Live Up To Its <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4949250-walmart-failing-to-live-up-to-rich-multiples-downgrade\">Rich P/E Multiples</a>.<br/><br/>Revisiting VICI Properties (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/VICI\" title=\"VICI Properties Inc.\">VICI</a>) - I'm Flipping <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4948569-vici-properties-im-flipping-from-buy-to-sell-rating-downgrade\">From Buy To Sell</a>.</p> <p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\">Weekly Movement</p> <p><span><strong>U.S. Indices</strong><br/>Dow <span class=\"green\">+0.3%</span> to 51,829. S&amp;P 500 <span class=\"green\">+1.2%</span> to 7,743. Nasdaq <span class=\"green\">+2.1%</span> to 27,069. Russell 2000 <span class=\"red\">-0.8%</span> to 2,838. CBOE Volatility Index <span class=\"green\">+0.4%</span> to 14.87. <br/><br/><strong>S&amp;P 500 Sectors</strong><br/>Consumer Staples <span class=\"green\">+0.2%</span>. Utilities <span class=\"red\">-3.2%</span>. Financials <span class=\"red\">-1.6%</span>. Telecom <span class=\"green\">+2.2%</span>. Healthcare <span class=\"green\">+1.7%</span>. Industrials <span class=\"green\">+0.7%</span>. Information Technology <span class=\"green\">+3.1%</span>. Materials <span class=\"green\">+0.3%</span>. Energy <span class=\"red\">-3%</span>. Consumer Discretionary <span class=\"red\">-0.5%</span>. Real Estate <span class=\"red\">-1.3%</span>. <br/><br/><strong>World Indices</strong><br/>London <span class=\"green\">+0.3%</span> to 10,695. France <span class=\"green\">+0.2%</span> to 8,078. Germany <span class=\"green\">+0.4%</span> to 25,409. Japan <span class=\"green\">+2.1%</span> to 66,364. China <span class=\"red\">-0.6%</span> to 3,888. Hong Kong <span class=\"red\">-1%</span> to 24,510. India <span class=\"red\">-0.5%</span> to 73,896. <br/><br/><strong>Commodities and Bonds</strong><br/>Crude Oil WTI <span class=\"red\">-3.8%</span> to $92.44/bbl. Gold <span class=\"red\">-2.4%</span> to $4,320.5/oz. Natural Gas <span class=\"green\">+10.4%</span> to 3.214. Ten-Year Bond Yield -0.2 bps to 5.167. <br/><br/><strong>Forex and Cryptos</strong><br/>EUR/USD <span class=\"red\">-0.81%</span>. USD/JPY <span class=\"green\">+0.25%</span>. GBP/USD <span class=\"red\">-1.11%</span>. Bitcoin <span class=\"green\">+3.3%</span>. Litecoin <span class=\"green\">+23.6%</span>. Ethereum <span class=\"green\">+2%</span>. XRP <span class=\"green\">+10.%</span>. <br/><br/><strong>Top S&amp;P 500 Gainers</strong><br/>Moderna (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/MRNA\" title=\"Moderna, Inc.\">MRNA</a>) <span class=\"green\">+29%</span>. Everpure (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/P\" title=\"Everpure, Inc.\">P</a>) <span class=\"green\">+21%</span>. Datadog (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/DDOG\" title=\"Datadog, Inc.\">DDOG</a>) <span class=\"green\">+17%</span>. Cadence Design Systems (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/CDNS\" title=\"Cadence Design Systems, Inc.\">CDNS</a>) <span class=\"green\">+15%</span>. QUALCOMM (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/QCOM\" title=\"QUALCOMM Incorporated\">QCOM</a>) <span class=\"green\">+14%</span>. <br/><br/><strong>Top S&amp;P 500 Losers</strong><br/>Gen Digital (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/GEN\" title=\"Gen Digital Inc.\">GEN</a>) <span class=\"red\">-25%</span>. MGM Resorts (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/MGM\" title=\"MGM Resorts International\">MGM</a>) <span class=\"red\">-14%</span>. Paychex (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/PAYX\" title=\"Paychex, Inc.\">PAYX</a>) <span class=\"red\">-13%</span>. Charter Communications (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/CHTR\" title=\"Charter Communications, Inc.\">CHTR</a>) <span class=\"red\">-12%</span>. CF Industries Holdings (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/CF\" title=\"CF Industries Holdings, Inc.\">CF</a>) <span class=\"red\">-10%</span>. <br/><br/><i>Where will the markets be headed next week? Current trends and ideas? Add your thoughts <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4949959-what-moved-markets-this-week\">to the comments section.</a></i></span></p> </div></body></html>",
